        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Khao Sok Blog: Riverside Cottages</span>
        </h2>
        <h3 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-10 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
          <span>Places to stay in Khao Sok National Park</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          These blogs will help you find the best places to stay in <a href="/khao-sok-national-park/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Khao Sok National Park</a>. Khao Sok is a bit off the beaten track. That is its charm and why it is such an amazing place to visit. Nevertheless it is no wonder that many people scratch their heads and ask themselves – Khao Sok National Park where to stay?
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          We will introduce you to the area and the amazing Khao Sok resort that is Khao Sok Riverside Cottages. We will also be able to help you decide on things to do as well as the local layout.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          One thing that defines places to stay in Khao Sok National Park is the restricted availability. In the park itself you have only 2 choices – The floating bungalows and jungle camping. Most people will not be comfortable spending more than a day or two in this kind of accommodation. Therefore the village of Mueng Sok is the first place to look for Khao Sok accommodation.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          There are a number of resorts. <a href="/" class="text-[#1b432c] underline decoration-[#ba9038]/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#ba9038] hover:text-[#7a5813] transition-colors">Riverside Cottages</a> is situated in the perfect location. Just away from the hustle and bustle of the village and right on the banks of the Sok River. We are set in wonderful natural forest gardens. Reception will help you with everything you need to know to get the most from your visit. Please read these articles.
        </p>
