        <p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
          Khao Sok National Park and the floating houses are must-see spots for every traveler visiting Thailand. The unique imagination of unreal sunrise and sunset colors is one of the true highlights of Southern Thailand. A great way to enjoy the bungalows is on a Khao Sok 2-day tour. This is a personal guide to our overnight stay on the lake. Volunteers Toti and Ale took this tour while staying at Khao Sok Riverside Cottages. They enjoyed a nice retreat away from the land. We delve into everything you need to know about our Khao Sok 2-day tour. Enjoy two amazing days and one [...]
